      <marc:subfield code="a">Angel was a deaf girl who never gave up. Her mother died after giving her birth. She believed that she was born as what God wished. She got difficulties to enter formal school as there were a lot of schools refusing her. At last there was a school accepting her. When she offered herself to be in a music group, she was refused because she could not hear. Her father told her that she could play a kind of music from her heart. It was true, she could play piano</marc:subfield>
